 "notes": [
  "Posted 27 July 2001 with no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards marked '(Start)' in the post: Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost, Endor, Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Endor: Bunker, Wakeelmui ('Start if not stopped'), Power Of The Hutt, You Cannot Hide Forever and Mobilization Points ('Start...?'); Prepared Defenses is in the list as the starting interrupt. They are listed in their sections and count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Endor Ops/Never Gonna See It' dested the objective Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost: the deck starts Endor, the Endor Landing Platform and the Bunker, which is that objective's text; 'Never Gonna See It' is the poster's own name for the back side.",
  "Posted 'Endor', 'Sullust', 'Kashyyyk', 'Mon Calamari', 'Endor Landing Platform (Docking Bay)' and 'Endor Bunker' dested the Dark pages Endor (Dark), Sullust (Dark), Kashyyyk (Dark), Mon Calamari (Dark), Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay) (Dark) and Endor: Bunker (Dark).",
  "Posted 'R2-A5' dested R2-A5 (Artoo-Ayfive) (Special Edition), the droid behind the strategy's 'Fel+Droid+Dreadnaught'.",
  "Posted 'Battle Deployment - Admiral's Order' dested the Admiral's Order Battle Deployment; 'Short Range Fighters' Short-range Fighters; 'Power Of The Hutt' the printed card, not the later Virtual version.",
  "The Characters header says 13 but 12 characters are listed; the deck totals 60 as published."
